\newlabel{fig:per-skill}{{4}{11}{Per-skill procedural-$\Delta $ at v2.0 ($n{=}5$ per skill, 40 skills). 11 skills lift on \CU ; 25 are flat (mostly because \BL {} is already at ceiling); 4 regress. The lift cluster concentrates on interpretive and spatial-social skills; the regression cluster on deductive-logic skills where the model has ceiling competence on \BL }{figure.caption.8}{}}
